technically, yes, I suppose you could say that art is artifice, that it imposes something artificial on the real, but I don''t think it''s necessary to put a filter on it. There is already art in what you are doing. That''s the point of photography. The art is the framing, the choice of a space and time, and you chose well. but the filter is not assuring. the filter is numbing.</td>', 'technically, yes, I suppose you could say that art is artifice, that it imposes something artificial on the real, but I don''t think it''s necessary to put a filter on it. There is already art in what you are doing. That''s the point of photography. The art is the framing, the choice of a space and time, and you chose well. but the filter is not assuring. the filter is numbing.', '2025-06-09 23:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
