(7782861, 1294955, 50695, '<td valign="top">
I don''t know what this is, which makes it hard to vote on. The silhouette is very realistic. the proportions and perspective are accurate. It looks like a shape cut out of a cloth. If an artist made this and hung it on a wall, they deserve probably most of the credit, although I do like the capture, with how you cropped it and the blur on the right.
<br/>
<br/>If I just look at it as art, I would say it reminds me of Narcissus, but instead of falling into a lake because he''s looking at his own reflection, he falls because he is looking at his phone and not looking where he''s going.
<br/>
<br/>Actually now that I look at this more, maybe it is a reflection in water and the image was inverted in some way. Okay, I inverted it and that''s totally what this is. I love this. It''s funny and transformative and disorienting. 10</td>', 'I don''t know what this is, which makes it hard to vote on. The silhouette is very realistic. the proportions and perspective are accurate. It looks like a shape cut out of a cloth. If an artist made this and hung it on a wall, they deserve probably most of the credit, although I do like the capture, with how you cropped it and the blur on the right.

If I just look at it as art, I would say it reminds me of Narcissus, but instead of falling into a lake because he''s looking at his own reflection, he falls because he is looking at his phone and not looking where he''s going.

Actually now that I look at this more, maybe it is a reflection in water and the image was inverted in some way. Okay, I inverted it and that''s totally what this is. I love this. It''s funny and transformative and disorienting. 10', '2025-06-11 23:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7782862, 1295115, 50695, '<td valign="top">
art is a view into another world. art is a matrix lain upon another world. its coordinates guide us in, but it has its own features, its own furniture. art is the lobby of another world. There''s a potted plant in the lobby. art is a skewed mirror. art is an electromagnetic telescope powered by a child on a bicycle.</td>', 'art is a view into another world. art is a matrix lain upon another world. its coordinates guide us in, but it has its own features, its own furniture. art is the lobby of another world. There''s a potted plant in the lobby. art is a skewed mirror. art is an electromagnetic telescope powered by a child on a bicycle.', '2025-06-11 23:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7782863, 1295147, 50695, '<td valign="top">
you have a good eye. I like the blue tinge to everything. Keep in mind that art creates a world, at least according to Heidegger... I think he said that. Anyway, your world is mostly stable, which is pleasing but not disorienting... and without disorientation, the reader can''t fully fall into the world. On the other hands, I do like how far you pushed the processing. It reminds me of the kind of stuff you see under a microscope. When you''re not constrained by "Standard Editing" I would deconstruct this even more.</td>', 'you have a good eye. I like the blue tinge to everything. Keep in mind that art creates a world, at least according to Heidegger... I think he said that. Anyway, your world is mostly stable, which is pleasing but not disorienting... and without disorientation, the reader can''t fully fall into the world. On the other hands, I do like how far you pushed the processing. It reminds me of the kind of stuff you see under a microscope. When you''re not constrained by "Standard Editing" I would deconstruct this even more.', '2025-06-11 23:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
